    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>*knock Knock*</i></strong><br>A knock at the door? Who could it be?<br><i>You go open the door. Nobody's there.<br>At least that's what it seems like, until a tiny voice pulls your gaze to the floor.<br>You see a tiny elephant, no bigger than a softball, wave at you...</i></h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955180/extras/f03c310ebd5f1213ed01551ffa531b71.avif?t=1748335410\" width=381 height=98 /></span><br><br>Elfie is a game about a small round elephant named Elfie.<br>Grow your friendship with your cute little new friend (and roommate).<br>Learn about all her hobbies, her favorite things and enjoy her company.<br>A casual and laid back experience that you can play at your own pace!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955180/extras/c7fe1a9f677f27248a62cd0330f80dbf.avif?t=1748335410\" width=500 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Elfie blends elements from the virtual pet, minigame compilation and visual novel genres.</i></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> Virtual Friend (Pet)</strong>: Make sure she's eating a balanced diet (not just peanut butter), cleaning up after herself and, most importantly, getting enough sleep and attention.<br></li><li><strong> Minigames</strong>: Inspired by the nostalgia of multicart cartridges, the collection of minigames represents things that Elfie enjoys doing and her various hobbies.<br></li><li><strong> Non-Linear Narrative</strong>: Your interactions with her will shape your friendship. And not only through dialogue. For example: <i>Do you visit her everyday? Do you always play the same minigames? Do you take a lot of time answering her questions?</i> Different players may come out with different experiences.<br></li><li><strong> Wholesome and casual</strong>: The game is meant to be a relaxing, positive and thoughtful experience. Play it and experience it as you please!<br></li><li><strong> Elfie</strong>: So cute! That's a feature in itself!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits:</h2>PV2 Music: &quot;Bitsy&quot; by silent swimmer",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>*knock Knock*</i></strong><br>A knock at the door? Who could it be?<br><i>You go open the door. Nobody's there.<br>At least that's what it seems like, until a tiny voice pulls your gaze to the floor.<br>You see a tiny elephant, no bigger than a softball, wave at you...</i></h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955180/extras/f03c310ebd5f1213ed01551ffa531b71.avif?t=1748335410\" width=381 height=98 /></span><br><br>Elfie is a game about a small round elephant named Elfie.<br>Grow your friendship with your cute little new friend (and roommate).<br>Learn about all her hobbies, her favorite things and enjoy her company.<br>A casual and laid back experience that you can play at your own pace!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955180/extras/c7fe1a9f677f27248a62cd0330f80dbf.avif?t=1748335410\" width=500 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Elfie blends elements from the virtual pet, minigame compilation and visual novel genres.</i></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> Virtual Friend (Pet)</strong>: Make sure she's eating a balanced diet (not just peanut butter), cleaning up after herself and, most importantly, getting enough sleep and attention.<br></li><li><strong> Minigames</strong>: Inspired by the nostalgia of multicart cartridges, the collection of minigames represents things that Elfie enjoys doing and her various hobbies.<br></li><li><strong> Non-Linear Narrative</strong>: Your interactions with her will shape your friendship. And not only through dialogue. For example: <i>Do you visit her everyday? Do you always play the same minigames? Do you take a lot of time answering her questions?</i> Different players may come out with different experiences.<br></li><li><strong> Wholesome and casual</strong>: The game is meant to be a relaxing, positive and thoughtful experience. Play it and experience it as you please!<br></li><li><strong> Elfie</strong>: So cute! That's a feature in itself!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits:</h2>PV2 Music: &quot;Bitsy&quot; by silent swimmer",
    "short_description": "Ever wondered what it would be like to have an elephant the size of a softball as a friend? Elfie is a unique and cozy experience that combines elements of pet simulators, minigame collections and visual novels to answer just that! Enjoy the company and hobbies of your new rotund friend!",
